{"id":"capital","lemma":"capital","pos":"adj","rank":2076,"glosses":["capital (important)","capital (relating to a death sentence)"],"ipa":"/kapiˈtal/","forms":{"femininePlural":"capitales"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-capital.wav","examples":[{"text":"Hicieron un viaje a la capital.","en":"They took a trip to the capital.","words":[{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"voyage"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Estoy en contra de la pena capital.","en":"I'm against capital punishment.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/721982","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,null,null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"punishment, sentence"},null],"phrases":[[1,4,"against"]]},{"text":"Soy totalmente contrario a la pena capital.","en":"I'm totally against capital punishment.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/721981","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"totally"},{"g":"contrary, opposite"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"punishment, sentence"},null]},{"text":"La compañía tiene un capital de un millón de dólares.","en":"The company has a capital of a million dollars.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"company"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"million"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"dollar","l":"dólar"}]},{"text":"La envidia es uno de los siete pecados capitales.","en":"Envy is one of the seven deadly sins.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"envy"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"one"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"seven"},{"g":"sin","l":"pecado"},null]}]}